      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> Tree Set is also a child class of Set .\n\n--> It also doesn't store duplicate data .\n\n--> It also doesn't support indexes .\n\n--> It store self balancing BST data structure to store data .\n\n--> When we traverse a TreeSet it we always get sorted data .",
